{'symbol': 'UNP', 'date': '2022-01-25 18:00:00', 'title': 'LOUP LOGISTICS ACQUIRES PHOENIX TRANSLOAD FACILITY', 'text': 'OMAHA, NEB., JAN. 25, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LOUP LOGISTICS COMPANY (LOUP), A WHOLLY OWNED UNION PACIFIC RAILROAD SUBSIDIARY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE ACQUISITION OF THE PRECISION COMPONENTS INC. (PCI RELOAD) TRANSLOAD FACILITY IN PHOENIX, ARIZONA.'}